## 2. Authentication Assessment

### Current State: 🔴 CRITICAL

| Feature | Status | Finding |
|---------|--------|---------|
| Email/Password Login | ✅ Implemented | Functional via Supabase Auth |
| Email Verification | ❌ Disabled | `enable_confirmations = false` in [config.toml L226](file:///c:/Users/veere/Downloads/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/flowtracker/supabase/config.toml#L226) — users can log in immediately with unverified email addresses |
| Password Policy | 🔴 Weak | `minimum_password_length = 6`, `password_requirements = ""` — accepts trivial passwords like `123456` |
| Password Reset | ⚠️ Functional | Uses Supabase built-in reset flow; no confirm-old-password, `secure_password_change = false` |
| MFA / 2FA | ❌ Disabled | TOTP and Phone MFA both have `enroll_enabled = false`, `verify_enabled = false` |
| Captcha | ❌ Disabled | `auth.captcha` section is commented out |
| Session Management | ⚠️ Partial | Token refresh rotation enabled (`refresh_token_reuse_interval = 10`), but no session timeouts (`timebox`, `inactivity_timeout` commented out) |
| JWT Expiry | ⚠️ Default | 3600 seconds (1 hour) — acceptable but no absolute session limit |
| Brute Force Protection | ⚠️ Minimal | Supabase rate limits `sign_in_sign_ups = 30` per 5 min, but no app-level account lockout |
| SSO / Enterprise IdP | ❌ None | No SAML/OIDC integration |
| Sign Out | ✅ Basic | Calls `supabase.auth.signOut()` but does not invalidate server-side sessions |
| Self-Registration | 🔴 Open | Anyone can register with any role, including admin — open registration with zero gatekeeping |

### Enterprise Requirements — Target State

| Feature | Requirement |
|---------|-------------|
| Email Verification | **Mandatory** before first login |
| Password Policy | Minimum 12 characters, `lower_upper_letters_digits_symbols`, breach dictionary check |
| MFA | **Mandatory** for Admin, HR, Team Lead; **Available** for Employee, Candidate |
| Session Timeout | 8-hour inactivity timeout; 24-hour absolute session timeout |
| Account Lockout | Lock account after 5 failed attempts for 15 minutes (progressive) |
| Captcha | Turnstile on registration + password reset flows |
| SSO | SAML 2.0 integration for enterprise identity providers |
| Self-Registration | **Disabled** for internal roles. Only Candidate self-registration with approval workflow. Admin/HR must create internal users. |

